{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wheelborne</strong> is a fast-paced, physics-driven platformer where every bump, slope, and jump can send your vehicle flipping into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission is to take control of powerful vehicles and guide them through deadly courses, avoiding traps, balancing on steep terrain, and reaching the finish line in one piece.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level tests your skill and reflexes as you race across deserts, cities, and cliffs filled with jumps, gaps, and brutal turns. Realistic physics means every movement matters \u2014 slow down too much, and you\u2019ll stall; rush ahead, and you risk total wipeout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and drive multiple vehicles, each with unique handling. Want more than just survival? <strong>Push your limits, beat time records, and climb the global leaderboards</strong> to prove your mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude99 Multiple cars with unique strengths and driving styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Diverse environments: deserts, cityscapes, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Deadly terrain with jumps, traps, slopes, and narrow paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to tame the road and become the ultimate <strong>Wheelborne</strong> legend?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862760?t=1753864104","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862760?t=1753864104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862760/1d21e627c1f9da899c37e33d750d4e00a55d0e18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753864104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862760/1d21e627c1f9da899c37e33d750d4e00a55d0e18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753864104